 q('You need another person to read, but not change, your document. Start with…','Viewing access for their account.','Editing access for anyone with a link.','Your account password.','Give the access needed for the task, without handing over your account.'),
 q('A download has a .pdf extension. What does that establish?','Its claimed format, not its safety.','That the sender is genuine.','That it came from a government department.','An extension is not an identity or security check.'),
 q('You close a tab on a shared tablet. Are you definitely signed out?','No; check the account and sign out.','Yes; every closed tab ends the session.','Yes; only downloaded files keep accounts open.','Login sessions can remain after tabs close.'),
 q('A cloud file says syncing. You need it on another device now. What next?','Wait for confirmation and open the file on the other device to check.','Assume the newest copy must already be there.','Delete the local copy immediately.','Confirm transfer before relying on the other copy.'),
 q('You want to edit a draft later and send a stable reading copy now. Keep…','The editable original and an exported copy.','Only a photograph of the screen.','Only the recipient’s copy.','Different file versions can serve different purposes.'),
 q('A friend asks for your password to help edit one document. What fits the task?','Use the document’s sharing controls instead.','Send the password and change it next month.','Put the password in the document title.','Sharing one document should not require sharing account control.'),
