 q('A browser pop-up claims the device is infected and offers a repair download. What now?','Close it and use the device’s trusted security settings or get trusted help.','Install the offered repair tool immediately.','Call only the number in the pop-up.','The pop-up is not a trusted diagnosis or support channel.'),
 q('You discover you shared the wrong document. What is a useful first action?','Revoke unintended access where possible and inform the intended person appropriately.','Assume deleting your message removes all copies.','Make the folder public so the link works.','Access can often be reduced, but copies already made may remain.')
